as huà (as opposed to huǒ for 夥) https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl? ... kMandarin property values for these two ideographs were as follows from Unicode Version","title":"L2/25-186 (CJK & Unihan Working Group Recommendations for UTC Meeting #184)","url":"https://www.unicode.org/L2/L2025/25186-cjk-unihan-wg-utc184.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn0search4","snippet":"# Search the Unihan Database ... For example, to find all ideographs whose definition contain the word “well,” enter “well” into the text field, select","title":"Unihan Database Search Page","url":"https://www.unicode.org/charts/unihansearch.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn0search14","snippet":"In the current version of the Unihan database, U+8034 耳 has a kMandarin value of ‘yi’ and a kCantonese value of ‘ngat6’, while U+43B2 耲","title":"L2/24-067 (CJK & Unihan Working Group Recommendations for UTC #179 Meeting)","url":"https://www.unicode.org/L2/L2024/24067-cjk-unihan-wg-utc179.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn0search5","snippet":"kHanyuPinyin value but no kMandarin value: ... https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=%E4%BA%80","title":"Public Review Issues","url":"https://www.unicode.org/review/pri483/feedback.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn0search15","snippet":"Recommendations (Unihan-UTC168-R19): The group recommends to the UTC the following disposition ⇒ Accept the *kMandarin* property value changes and additions as specified in L2/21-119, based","title":"L2/21-129 (CJK & Unihan Group Recommendations for UTC #168 Meeting)","url":"https://www.unicode.org/L2/L2021/21129-cjk-unihan-group-utc168.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn0search16","snippet":"UCS U+5D74 | Char 嵴 | kMandarin (current) jǐ | kMandarin (new) jí | Remarks Follow the single reading in kTGHZ2013 --- | --- |","title":"Subject: | Proposal to change various values in the Unihan Database | L2/22-008 | --- | --- | --- | --- | | L2/22-008 None | Date: | 2022-01-03 | L2/22-008 None | To: | UTC | L2/22-008 None | From: | Jaemin Chung | L2/22-008 None | Pages: | 22 | L2/22-008 None |Section 1: kMandarin","url":"https://www.unicode.org/L2/L2022/22008-unihan-chg.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn0search6","snippet":"# Re: What is the Source of \"kMandarin\" in Unihan.txt? ... This is covered by one of the CJK FAQs <http://unicode.org/faq/han_cjk.html>.","title":"Unicode Mail List Archive: Re: What is the Source of \"kMandarin\" in Unihan.txt?","url":"https://www.unicode.org/mail-arch/unicode-ml/y2010-m01/0247.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"unicode.org","ref_id":"turn0search7","snippet":"> This page provides the entire Unihan repertoire of the Unicode Standard in blocks of 256 ideographs.Each block is identified by all but the last","title":"Unihan Database","url":"https://unicode.org/charts/unihangridindex.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn0search8","snippet":"https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr38/tr38-38.htmlModifications ... Unicode Han Database (Unihan) ... V17.0.0中Unihan_Readings中kMandarin读音建议改为： ... U+57E4 埤 pí 建议改为： pì","url":"https://www.unicode.org/L2/L2025/25220-pubrev.html"}]}}
